    skos:editorialNote "Curated classification (group=grp_metal_machinery_hardware): Unenumerated metal manufactures belong with Metalwares (as htc:0270 Iron Manufactures Unenumerated already does), not with paper/glass/sundries. Layer-1 observations: 108 rows, 1820–1906. Series: HCPP_Annual Statement of Trade ×63; KEW_CUST 4 ×18; CSP_Canadian_Exports_BlankSeries (inferred, series not printed) ×27. Units: CWTS (Hundredweights) ×49; (no unit) ×45; Tons ×14. Top routes: Canada → England ×13; France → United Kingdom ×5; Sweden → United Kingdom ×5; World → United Kingdom ×5."@en ;
